Scope note
==========

This licence covers only the files in this repository: the configuration files,
NVIDIA profiles, PowerShell scripts, the modified Cg shader source, and the
documentation.

It does NOT cover, and this package does not redistribute, any part of Cry of
Fear or of the GoldSrc engine. Cry of Fear is the property of Team Psykskallar;
GoldSrc is Valve's. Users must own the game. Nothing here replaces a game
binary; `install/cgshaders/black_fp.cg` is a derivative edit of a shader
shipped with the game and is provided as a source file for users to apply to
their own copy, never as a redistribution of game content.
